_paragraph\" ><strong>Double Jump</strong>: Perfect your skills with the ability to jump again mid-air, mastering even the trickiest platforms and reaching new heights. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller and Steam Deck Support</strong>: Enjoy seamless gameplay whether you're using a controller or playing on the Steam Deck, allowing you to play comfortably on the go or from the comfort of your couch. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Platforming</strong>: Focus solely on your platforming skills with no distractions\u2014no bosses, weapons, or NPCs\u2014just you and the thrill of mastering each climb and jump. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultra low graphics option</strong>: Optimize your gaming experience with a retro graphics setting designed specifically for older computers, ensuring smooth gameplay without compromising on fun. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Automatic rewind</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't need to restart the level if you fall; the automatic rewind feature saves your progress on every platform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058710/extras/823596401bb30feb0f72ff05c9236d6a.poster.avif?t=1746528098\" width=600 height=259 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058710/extras/823596401bb30feb0f72ff05c9236d6a.webm?t=1746528098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Speedrun Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself to complete all levels in one seamless run while the clock ticks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=